# Eval runs: a few megabytes of PNG each, belonging to whoever produced them.
# What gets compared between runs is the numbers in the report, and re-running
# is cheaper than reviewing a diff of binary renders.
#
# Anchored to the repo root. An unanchored "evals/" matches at any depth and
# silently excludes src/minecraft_builder/evals/ — the harness itself.
/evals/

